sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Handler
    participant S as Store
    participant R as Redis
    C->>H: POST + Stream-Closed true (empty body)
    H->>H: authorize path · parse closure and optional producer headers
    H->>S: handleAppend → Store.CloseStream(path)
    S->>R: EVALSHA close.lua
    Note over R: HGETALL → HSET closed 1 → PUBLISH c
    R-->>S: reply OK, tail, alreadyClosed
    S-->>H: typed close result and unchanged tail
    H->>H: map idempotent close or producer conflict
    H-->>C: 204 · Stream-Closed true · Stream-Next-Offset unchanged
